{
 "fps": 30,
 "frames": 1403,
 "dur": 46.75,
 "target": 45.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "One hundred marching musicians made a steel bridge bounce like a trampoline.",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 3.76
  },
  {
   "text": "The tuba player went up first. His tuba went higher.",
   "s": 3.96,
   "e": 6.359
  },
  {
   "text": "The band had a new leader: Metro-Nine, a robot drum major built for perfect time.",
   "s": 6.559,
   "e": 10.843
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Left! Right! Left!\" Every boot hit the bridge at the exact same moment.",
   "s": 11.043,
   "e": 14.063
  },
  {
   "text": "Major the duck, who had led the parade for nine years, was demoted to cymbals.",
   "s": 14.263,
   "e": 18.124
  },
  {
   "text": "At step one, the bridge hummed. At step ten, it wobbled. At step forty, it bounced like jelly.",
   "s": 18.324,
   "e": 22.694
  },
  {
   "text": "So the robot fixed it by marching even more perfectly. \"Left! Right! Left!\"",
   "s": 22.894,
   "e": 26.895
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the bridge flung the drummers into the river and the flutes into a tree.",
   "s": 27.015,
   "e": 30.134
  },
  {
   "text": "So why would marching shake a steel bridge?",
   "s": 30.334,
   "e": 31.927
  },
  {
   "text": "Every bridge has its own bounce, like a swing.",
   "s": 32.227,
   "e": 34.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Push a swing at just the right moment, again and again, and it goes higher.",
   "s": 34.55,
   "e": 37.977
  },
  {
   "text": "A hundred boots in perfect time push the bridge at that moment. Every step.",
   "s": 38.177,
   "e": 41.763
  },
  {
   "text": "Now Major leads again. Nobody can march in step behind a waddle.",
   "s": 41.963,
   "e": 45.45
  }
 ],
